    <string name="notes">"Notes:
• Each widget has independent settings: media, frame rate, resolution, shape and opacity don't affect others.
• Background playback uses a foreground service and a high-priority render thread; some ROMs still limit it. Try “Background optimization (Shizuku)” or the battery whitelist.
• Frames are stored as WebP in the app's private folder and removed with the app.
• High frame rate/large resolution increases heat and battery use; 12–30 fps at 720 px is recommended."</string>
